  [自由度为 $n-1$ 的 $chi^2$ 分布],
  [$chi^2 > chi^2_(alpha/2)(n-1)$ 或 $chi^2 < chi^2_(1-alpha/2)(n-1)$],

  [$sigma <= sigma_0$], [$--$], [$chi^2 = n S^2 / sigma_0^2$],
